# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Files previously carried a mix of CRLF and LF, sometimes within the same
# file (static/js/scripts.js had 1201 CRLF and 315 LF terminators). Every
# Windows checkout then produced a diff of whole files, hiding the real change:
# an apparent 11,924 insertions across 78 files was about 963 real lines.
#
# After changing this, normalise the working tree once:
#   git add --renormalize .
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.tf text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.db binary
